  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, the equation of circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, the centre of the circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the radius is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Assume, the coordinate of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the coordinate of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, the coordinate&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the coordinate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3eae8af9-e3a9-4920-a1d7-c0b84d91a29b-image.png\" style=\"width: 284px; height: 222px;\" /></p><p>From the diagram, area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
